Eric:

It is corrected many months ago in rfc8773bis.

Russ

> On Apr 24, 2026, at 12:09=E2=80=AFPM, Eric Rescorla <ekr@rtfm.com> =
wrote:
>=20
> I think that's the wrong answer. If we know there is a technical =
error, we should correct it in AUTH 48.
>=20
> -Ekr
>=20
>=20
> On Fri, Apr 24, 2026 at 7:23=E2=80=AFAM Russ Housley =
<housley@vigilsec.com <mailto:housley@vigilsec.com>> wrote:
>> Dear Security ADs:
>>=20
>> This should be HFDU, since 8773bis is already in the RFC Editor's =
queue.
>>=20
>> Russ
>>=20
>>=20
>> > On Apr 24, 2026, at 7:06=E2=80=AFAM, RFC Errata System =
<rfc-editor@rfc-editor.org <mailto:rfc-editor@rfc-editor.org>> wrote:
>> >=20
>> > The following errata report has been submitted for RFC8773,
>> > "TLS 1.3 Extension for Certificate-Based Authentication with an =
External Pre-Shared Key".
>> >=20
>> > --------------------------------------
>> > You may review the report below and at:
>> > https://www.rfc-editor.org/errata/eid8888
>> >=20
>> > --------------------------------------
>> > Type: Technical
>> > Reported by: Muhammad Usama Sardar =
<muhammad_usama.sardar@tu-dresden.de =
<mailto:muhammad_usama.sardar@tu-dresden.de>>
>> >=20
>> > Section: 7
>> >=20
>> > Original Text
>> > -------------
>> > Early Secret =3D HKDF-Extract(External PSK, 0)
>> >=20
>> > Corrected Text
>> > --------------
>> > Early Secret =3D HKDF-Extract(0, External PSK)
>> >=20
>> > Notes
>> > -----
>> > As discussed in =
https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/tls/6Wk82oBGd61rTK23DgfYb7BmRKM/ =
and https://github.com/tlswg/rfc8773bis/pull/2
>> >=20
>> > Instructions:
>> > -------------
>> > This erratum is currently posted as "Reported". (If it is spam, it=20=

>> > will be removed shortly by the RFC Production Center.) Please
>> > use "Reply All" to discuss whether it should be verified or
>> > rejected. When a decision is reached, the verifying party =20
>> > will log in to change the status and edit the report, if necessary.
>> >=20
>> > --------------------------------------
>> > RFC8773 (draft-ietf-tls-tls13-cert-with-extern-psk-07)
>> > --------------------------------------
>> > Title               : TLS 1.3 Extension for Certificate-Based =
Authentication with an External Pre-Shared Key
>> > Publication Date    : March 2020
>> > Author(s)           : R. Housley
>> > Category            : EXPERIMENTAL
>> > Source              : Transport Layer Security
>> > Stream              : IETF
>> > Verifying Party     : IESG
>>=20
